{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05840","headline":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 一 · 王维","name":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾弟东山时，心尚一何远。\n日高犹自卧，钟动始能饭。\n领上髪未梳，牀头书不卷。\n清川兴悠悠，空林对偃蹇。\n青苔石上净，细草松下软。\n窗外鸟声闲，阶前虎心善。\n徒然万象多，澹尔太虚缅。\n一知与物平，自顾爲人浅。\n对君忽自得，浮念不烦遣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}